      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<p>CLINICAL INDICATIONS<br>The sample of Ms. Vikash Kumar f/o baby Parvi Gupta, was requested for testing COL7A1 (NM_000094.4) Exon 2 [c.64C&gt;T (p.Arg22Ter)] and Exon 33 [c.3974del (p.Lys1325ArgfsTer74)] variants [Proband Id: A3849101; dated: 07-03-2024].<br>KEY FINDINGS</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.02%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 19.8746%;\"><col style=\"width: 21.3468%;\"><col style=\"width: 11.0366%;\"><col style=\"width: 22.2349%;\"><col style=\"width: 25.3217%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Gene &amp; Transcript&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Variant&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Exon</td>\n<td>Zygosity</td>\n<td>Results</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COL7A1 (NM_000094.4)</td>\n<td>c.64C&gt;T<br>p.Arg22Ter</td>\n<td>Exon 2</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>Not-Detected</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COL7A1 (NM_000094.4)&nbsp;</td>\n<td>c.3974del<br>p.Lys1325ArgfsTer74</td>\n<td>Exon 33</td>\n<td>Heterozygous (Depth - 59x/124x)</td>\n<td>Detected</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>INTERPRETATION<br>The tested variant COL7A1 (NM_000094.4) exon 33 [c.3974del p.Lys1325ArgfsTer74] was detected to be<br>heterozygous while exon 02 [c.64C&gt;T p.Arg22Ter] was not detected in the analysed sample.<br>RECOMMENDATIONS<br>1. Please correlate clinically<br>2. Genetic counseling for accurate interpretation of test results is recommended.<br>3. Segregation analysis of the above variants (testing of multiple affected as well as unaffected members) is<br>recommended. Variant classification may be modified after segregation analysis.</p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
      "_id": "679e65c29b8d71306eddf4d2"
    }
